{"strongs": "H1100", "word": "בְּלִיַּ֫עַל", "translit": "be.liy.ya.al", "root": "בית", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "worthlessness", "definition": "בְּלִיַּ֫עַל 27 noun [masculine] worthlessness (compound בְּלִי not, without and יַעַל worth, use, profit ) — ׳ בּ Deut 13:14 + 20 t.; בְּלִיָּ֑עַל Ps 101:3 + 5 t.; — the quality of being useless, good for nothing. 1. abstract אִישׁ (ה)בליעל , אַנְשֵׁי הבליעל , worthless, good-for-nothing, base fellows 1Sam 25:25 ; 2Sam 16:7 ; 2Sam 20:1 ; 1Kgs 21:13 ; Prov 16:27 = ׳ בֶּןבֿ 1Sam 25:17 , ׳ בְּנֵי ב Deut 13:14 ; Judg 19:22 ; Judg 20:13 ; 1Sam 2:12 ; 1Sam 10:27 ; 1Kgs 21:10 ; 1Kgs 21:13 ; 2Chr 13:7 ׳ בַּת ב 1Sam 1:16 (drunken woman); ׳ עֵד ב base witness Prov 19:28 ׳ דְּבַר ב base, wicked thing Ps 41:9 (yet compare 3 below), Ps 101:3 (add probably also 1Sam 29:10 , so ᵐ5 We Dr ); ׳ דָּבָרב֗֗֗ (elliptical and in apposition) Deut 15:9 . 2. concrete elliptical of ׳ אישׁ ב 2Sam 23:6 ; Job 34:18 כָּלאִֿישׁ רַע וּבְלִיַּעַל 1Sam 30:22 אָדָם בְּלִיַּעַל Prov 6:12 . 3. ruin, destruction: so Ps 41:9 according to De Che and others, but see above; ׳ יֹעֵץ ב counsellor of ruin Nah 1:11 ׳ ב alone a man of ruin, destroyer Nah 2:1 ׳ נַחֲלֵי ב floods of destruction (|| שְׁאוֺל ) 2Sam 22:5 = Ps 18:5 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1129')\">BDB1129</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1100')\">H1100</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1128')\">BDB1128</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1130')\">BDB1130</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>בְּלִיַּ֫עַל</bdbheb><sub>27</sub> <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>worthlessness</highlightword> (compound <bdbheb>בְּלִי</bdbheb> <highlight>not, without</highlight> and <bdbheb>יַעַל</bdbheb> <highlight>worth, use, profit</highlight>) — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 13:14\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(5,13,14)\">Deut 13:14</ref> + 20 t.; <bdbheb>בְּלִ